      "content": "it's just hard to see a way out of this debt. not like money, but like... the debt of existing. i've invested everything i am into this world and it just took it all back. if the game is rigged and the results are always going to be negative, why am i even still sitting here at the table? it feels like there's no point in continuing the investment when the venture is clearly bankrupt.",
